 "name_en": "Transfer of Primary Master Data for SAP Global Trade Services (1WA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Transfer of Primary Master Data for SAP Global Trade Services (1WA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Customers can integrate SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 on-premise with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to utilize existing rules in SAP Global Trade Services for trade being managed in the cloud.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the communication scenario and the appropriate RFC calls for synchronizing the primary master data of Customers, Suppliers, and Material Masters.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate global trade component</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Contact expert configuration for activation and definition of the infrastructure</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Synchronize the master data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage an existing investment in SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 for business being managed in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use the existing global trade services infrastructure for a best-of-breed deployment of an international trade solution with minimal new configuration</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>传输 SAP Global Trade Services 的主要主数据 (1WA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">客户可以集成 SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 企业预置与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>，以利用 SAP Global Trade Services 中的现有规则进行云端管理的贸易。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目启用通信场景和相应的 RFC 调用，以同步客户、供应商和物料主数据的主要主数据。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集成全球贸易组件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">联系专家配置，激活并定义基础架构</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">同步主数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio38515b0697aa409d9659ceae9ef68d11__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将 SAP Global Trade Services 11.0 中的现有投资应用于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中管理的业务</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用现有全球贸易服务基础设施，以最少的新配置以最佳方式部署国际贸易解决方案</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
